Quest 136 "Skull Collection"
    Journal for karus "You have promised to bring Apples of Moradon to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
    Journal for elmorad "You have promised to bring Apples of Moradon to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
    Collect 3 of 810418000

