Rewards
    Give 925000 experience

direction_101 = location "Skeleton Warrior" about "Skeleton Warrior\nAn undead like the undying, possesses great strength as it is composed of powerful bone structure" found "Karus" karus at 994 1141 in zone 1
direction_102 = location "Skeleton Warrior" about "Skeleton Warrior\nAn undead like the undying, possesses great strength as it is composed of powerful bone structure" found "El Morad" elmorad at 1280 728 in zone 2

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master! Shaimer is once again looking for some material..."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master! Clark is once again looking for some material..."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Wow, the grapevine's smoking today!\nSo, you remember Karon that you helped out before? She said that Blood of Beast you brought her was really quality stuff. So now she wants you to get her some  Skeletons!"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "You might already know, but anyway I want to ask you for those Skeletons. A friend told me you can easily get the Apple of Moradon from  Skeleton Warriors. Makes sense I suppose!\n\nKaron is my best friend, so I really don't want to let him down. Please, help me out on this one, Ok?"

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "My trust in you knows no bounds, <selfname>!! Heh!"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_101
    If player is elmorad
        Say "My trust in you knows no bounds, <selfname>!! Heh!"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_102

On ready
    Say "One, two, and three Apples of Moradon! Success!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "WoW, there's nothing you can't get!"
